  "root_cause": "The UI performs an explicit one-shot status query. A prepared/unauthorized snapshot can arrive before the authorization audit commits; later backend settlement does not mutate that rendered receipt. The exact original test assumed the one query would already be ready. Raw native state also does not establish durable application authorization.",
